Step 6 — Streaming Support

If the RT agent supports streaming, preserve and integrate it.

Determine whether the RT agent uses:

* Server-Sent Events
* WebSockets
* chunked HTTP responses
* another streaming protocol

The UI must correctly handle:

stream started
partial response
tool or workflow status
final response
stream completed
stream error
stream cancelled

Target streaming flow:

UI
 │
 ▼
Open Agent Stream
 │
 ▼
Receive Event
 │
 ├── Partial Content → Update UI
 ├── Status Event → Update Progress
 ├── Final Event → Complete Response
 ├── Error Event → Show Error
 └── Close Event → Finalize State

Do not convert a streaming endpoint into a blocking request unless explicitly required.

If streaming is not supported by the RT agent, implement the standard request/response flow and document that limitation.

